{"answer":null,"concept_id":"roofline-which-peak-tc-or-cuda","content_sha256":"sha256:c2be0d0cf62caf7ba9022bb0037352b8a31373166ee175ad55e5a6aa5f9ccde1","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789366773.760253,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"已有 ridge 计算、decode/prefill 分侧。补\"用哪条屋顶\"。","id":"q-operator-roofline-tensor-vs-cuda-core-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"TC 峰值远高于 CUDA core，用错屋顶会把已经打满 TC 的核误判为\"还能再快 10 倍\"。必须用对应精度的 tensor roof，并交叉看 pipe utilization"},{"id":"b","text":"两种屋顶数值相同，选哪个无所谓"},{"id":"c","text":"应用 CUDA core 屋顶更保守，永远正确"},{"id":"d","text":"Roofline 不能画 Tensor Core"}],"prompt":"看 Roofline 时用 CUDA core 峰值当屋顶，一个已走 Tensor Core 的 GEMM 会显得怎样？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA Nsight Compute","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-compute/NsightCompute/index.html"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"roofline","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
